2. 368fa48 — Tank module slots out of the shared designer loc namespace

The root cause: tank chassis and plane airframes both used special_type_slot_N, and EQ_MOD_SLOT_<slot>_TITLE is keyed on slot name alone. Vanilla's plane_designer_l_english.yml aliases slots 5 and 6 to slot 4's title and won the lookup, so Computer/Radar and Loading System both rendered as "Optics".

All ten tank special slots renamed special_type_slot_N → tank_special_slot_N across 110 files:
- common/units/equipment/tank_chassis.txt
- 105 designer GUI files under interface/…/tanks/
- common/ai_equipment/generic_tank.txt
